  "question": {
    "text": "The points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>82</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "giYyB",
      "text": "form an obtuse angled triangle",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ObMKc",
      "text": "form an acute angled triangle",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GIZxT",
      "text": "lie on a straight line",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "xmwC1",
      "text": "form a right angled triangle",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The points,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>82</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are collinear, as slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo></math>slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math> i.e.,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>82</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, option (Lie on a straight line) is correct.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
